# Read by Cloudflare from the deployed asset root. `public/` is copied into
# `dist/` verbatim, and wrangler.toml points [assets] at `dist`, so this file
# ships as `/_redirects`.
#
# /things was the blog's URL before the migration. Those links are in the wild
# and in Google's index, so they keep working.
#
# The old /things-content/* image URLs have no successor — post media is
# fingerprinted into /_astro now — so they are left to 404 rather than
# redirected somewhere that would also 404.
/things       /blog          301
/things/*     /blog/:splat   301
